        "published_at": null,
        "checked_at": "2026-11-09",
        "excerpt": "born August 23, 1985 ... Education: Duke University (BA) ... Miller began attending Duke University in 2003 to study political science. ... After graduating in 2007 ... Miller began working for Minnesota representative Michele Bachmann by December 2007 as her press secretary. ... Horowitz referred Miller to Arizona representative John Shadegg. ... in June 2009, Miller began working for Alabama senator Jeff Sessions as his press secretary. ... Miller became Sessions's communications manager by August 2014. ... In January 2016, Miller joined Trump's presidential campaign as a senior policy advisor. ... By August, he had become Trump's national policy director. ... After Trump won the 2016 election, Miller retained his role as national policy director for the transition.",
